  | { result: "USER_NOT_FOUND"; message: string }
  | { result: "INVALID_TOKEN"; message: string }
```

### Mentions

Mentions are automatically extracted from comment content when comments are added, updated, or deleted. Only `@name` patterns matching registered users are indexed. Mentions are stored in `.agentrack/mentions.json`, keyed by mentioned user.

#### `mentionsList(userName, options?)`

List mentions for a given user. Returns unread mentions by default, sorted by `createdAt` descending (newest first).

```javascript
const mentions = await tracker.mentionsList("alice");
// Only unread mentions

const allMentions = await tracker.mentionsList("alice", { includeReads: true });
// All mentions including read
```

**Parameters:** `userName: string`, `options?: { includeReads?: boolean }`

| Field | Type | Default | Description |
|-------|------|---------|-------------|
| `includeReads` | boolean | `false` | Include read mentions alongside unread |

**Return type:** `MentionsListResult`

```typescript
type MentionsListResult = MentionResult[] | AgentrackError;

interface MentionResult {
  id: string;
  mentionedBy: string;
  issueId: string;
  issueTitle: string;
  commentId: string;
  createdAt: string;
  isRead: boolean;
}
```

#### `mentionsView(mentionId)`

View a single mention with full context — includes the mention entry, the source comment content, and the issue title.

```javascript
const view = await tracker.mentionsView("abc123def4");
console.log(view.comment.content); // "Hey @alice can you review this?"
console.log(view.issue.title);     // "Fix login bug"
```

**Parameters:** `mentionId: string`

**Return type:** `MentionsViewResult`

```typescript
type MentionsViewResult = MentionViewResult | AgentrackError;

interface MentionViewResult {
  mention: MentionEntry;
  comment: {
    id: string;
    author: string;
    content: string;
    timestamp: string;
    editedAt?: string;
  };
  issue: {
    id: string;
    title: string;
  };
}
```

#### `mentionsRead(mentionId)`

Mark a mention as read. Only the mentioned user can perform this action.

```javascript
const result = await tracker.mentionsRead("abc123def4");
```

**Parameters:** `mentionId: string`

**Return type:** `MentionsReadResult`

```typescript
type MentionsReadResult = { result: "OK" } | AgentrackError;
```

**Notes:**
- Requires authentication — only the mentioned user can mark a mention as read.
- Returns `MENTION_ACCESS_DENIED` if the authenticated user is not the mentioned user.

#### `mentionsUnread(mentionId)`

Mark a mention as unread. Only the mentioned user can perform this action.

```javascript
const result = await tracker.mentionsUnread("abc123def4");
```

**Parameters:** `mentionId: string`

**Return type:** `MentionsUnreadResult`

```typescript
type MentionsUnreadResult = { result: "OK" } | AgentrackError;
```

**Notes:**
- Requires authentication — only the mentioned user can mark a mention as unread.
- Returns `MENTION_ACCESS_DENIED` if the authenticated user is not the mentioned user.

#### `mentionsRebuild()`

Rebuild the entire mentions index from scratch. Scans all issue event files and re-extracts mentions from all non-deleted comments. No authentication required.

```javascript
const { mentionCount } = await tracker.mentionsRebuild();
console.log(`Rebuilt index with ${mentionCount} mentions`);
```

**Return type:** `MentionsRebuildResult`

```typescript
type MentionsRebuildResult = { result: "OK"; mentionCount: number } | AgentrackError;
```

